OL,3,GNEWSAWidow seeks to change
OL,4,A'overwhelming' inquest process
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaroline Roodhouse's world turned
OL,7,Fupside down when her husband, Steve,
OL,8,Fdied by suicide in 2018.
OL,10,FThe mum-of-two from Basingstoke was
OL,11,Fleft widowed and a single parent, then
OL,12,Fhad to attend an inquest to determine
OL,13,Fhow, when and where her husband had
OL,14,Fdied.
OL,16,FShe said the process was "horrendous"
OL,17,Fand is now working with other
OL,18,Fvolunteers to run sessions for coroner
OL,19,Fstaff to improve the process.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
